      "text": "- How knowledge is stored without external inscription\n- How long narratives (tens of thousands of lines) are composed in real time\n- Why texts like the Iliad have the structural features they do\n- Why similar tale types appear across unconnected cultures\n- What happens to transmitted information over time"
