        "title": "Oral Tradition: Memory, Performance, and Transmission - Landscape",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Writing enables:\n- Lists (non-narrative catalogues)\n- Tables (bi-directional lookup)\n- Formulas (algebraic, not just rhetorical)\n- Retrospective re-reading (checking for contradiction)\n- Syllogistic reasoning (abstract from context)"
    },
